{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35171","headline":"送洛阳崔员外 · 周繇","name":"送洛阳崔员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞诏除嵩洛，观图见废兴。\n城迁周古鼎，地列汉诸陵。\n日送归朝客，时招住岳僧。\n郡斋台阁满，公退即吟登。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}